<title>UK: Robert Fleming names strcutured finance director.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming names strcutured finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank Robert Fleming &amp; Co said on Thursday it has appointed Simon Davis as a director in its structured finance team.</p>
<p>Davis will be based in Singapore and be responsible for developing the structured finance capability of Jardine Fleming, Fleming's joint venture with Jardine Matheson.</p>
<p>Davis was previously at Rabobank in London and will report to Marcus Stanton who heads the structured finance team.</p>
<p>- Joe Ortiz, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
</text>
